      "id": 74231,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-09-23T01:32:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Because it doesn't have only 7 decks, it (as listed) has 5 heroes and 2 environments... in addition to that there are villain decks, which are a new method of playing.</p><p><span>\"In addition to 5 new heroes and 2 devious environments, this product provides a new mode of play for the heroes to face in the form of a team of villains\"</span></p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:54:10.622Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 8700,
      "topic_slug": "pre-orders-are-up",
      "display_username": "Matchstickman",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Because it doesn&#39;t have only 7 decks, it (as listed) has 5 heroes and 2 environments... in addition to that there are villain decks, which are a new method of playing.</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(247, 245, 235);\">&quot;In addition to 5 new heroes and 2 devious environments, this product provides a new mode of play for the heroes to face in the form of a team of villains&quot;</span></p>",
      "actions_summary": [
